trajrl  not set up
Welcome to trajrl.

This machine is not set up yet. On the website, open Settings and copy the line
under "Entry point". It looks like:

  trajrl setup -entry HOST:PORT -entry-key 'ssh-ed25519 AAAA...'

Paste it below and press enter: trajrl runs it, then shows your sandboxes.












setup>                                                                          

enter run  ctrl+c quit